    "content": {
      "id": "a767a8c3-24fb-30ff-adfc-6d2bf4065fd8",
      "contentType": "VIDEO",
      "title": "Talk of an AI bubble is just 'ridiculous,' this strategist says",
      "description": "<p>Investors are still going back and forth over whether there is an AI bubble surrounding markets (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI?p=%5EDJI&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC?p=%5EIXIC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^IXIC</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC?p=%5EGSPC&.tsrc=fin-srch\">^GSPC</a>) or whether it is going to pop soon. One Wall Street analyst finds the chatter over the existence of an AI bubble \"ridiculous.\"</p>\n<p>Humilis Investment Strategies CEO and Chief Investment Officer Brian Belski sits down with Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> to explain his thoughts on the AI trade, dynamic changes since the Dot-Com Bubble of the 1990s, and his view on the Magnificent Seven tech stocks.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
      "summary": "Investors are still going back and forth over whether there is an AI bubble surrounding markets (^DJI, ^IXIC, ^GSPC) or whether it is going to pop soon. One Wall Street analyst finds the chatter over the existence of an AI bubble \"ridiculous.\" Humilis Investment Strategies CEO and Chief Investment Officer Brian Belski sits down with Market Catalysts host Julie Hyman to explain his thoughts on the AI trade, dynamic changes since the Dot-Com Bubble of the 1990s, and his view on the Magnificent Seven tech stocks. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Catalysts.",
